<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ 77-day T-bills yield 7.279 percent at tender.</title>
<headline>NZ 77-day T-bills yield 7.279 percent at tender.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average yield for NZ$75 million of 77-day treasury bills at Tuesday's tender was 7.279 percent versus 7.20 percent for a similar maturity at last week's tender, the Reserve Bank said.</p>
<p>Bids totalled NZ$444 million.</p>
